# arb-dex-mcp — configuration.
#
# The server ships NO credentials. Everything below is set by YOU, the
# installing user, in your MCP client's config (or this file for local runs).

# Your own RapidAPI key. Required for the paid tools (get_chains, get_pairs,
# get_prices, get_spreads with live=true, get_history). The free-tier
# subscription is enough to start.
#   https://rapidapi.com/donnydev/api/multi-chain-dex-prices-liquidity
# Leave unset and the server still runs: get_chains, get_pairs and get_spreads
# fall back to the free public snapshot and say so in the payload.
RAPIDAPI_KEY=

# Optional overrides. Defaults are correct for the production service.
# ARB_DEX_FREE_BASE_URL=https://arb-dex-data-production.up.railway.app
# ARB_DEX_RAPIDAPI_HOST=multi-chain-dex-prices-liquidity.p.rapidapi.com

# Optional. A full-chain live scan is a real on-chain sweep and can take ~30s.
# ARB_DEX_TIMEOUT_MS=45000
